== non-minimal representative (one finger move) ==
m = 8  M(-1) = 6  W = [1, 1, 0, 0, -1, -2, 1]
disks with W=0 (empty bigons) are sign-changing: [True, True]
parity holds for this representative: False

identity M^(j)(-1) = c(-1)^j p^(j)(1): verified on 300 random multisets, j<6
shift d=0: factorial moments j=0..3 = [6, 3, 4, -6], p'(1) mod p(1) = 3
shift d=1: factorial moments j=0..3 = [6, 9, 10, 6], p'(1) mod p(1) = 3
shift d=3: factorial moments j=0..3 = [6, 21, 58, 120], p'(1) mod p(1) = 3
